000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    SREQMAN.
000400 AUTHOR.        KURT MOVSESIAN/JIM COFFMAN (MAINTAINER).
000600
000700*C    THIS PROGRAM ALLOWS THE USER TO PUT A MANUAL REQUEST
000800*C    FOR A CORP-CODE INTO THE MREQFILE DATA SET SO THE NEXT
000900*C    TIME THE REQ. CREATE PROGRAM IS RAN A REQ WILL BE CUT
001000*C    WITH THE CORP CODE ENTERED.
001100*C    ON FEB 14, 1983 A SECOND OPTION WAS ADDED ALLOW THE USER
001200*C    TO ENTER A CODE AND HAVE A REQUISITION NUMBER ASSIGNED AT
001300*C    THIS TIME BYPASSING THE MREQFILE DATA SET AND 'MA1'.
      *C
      *C    AUG 23, 1994  JE COFFMAN  WRITTEN REQUEST 94-001/SLS REQ 6487
      *C    ADDED THE ABILITY ON CORPORATE CODES FLAGGED WITH THE
      *C    AUTHORIZATION FLAG TO USE THE STOREROOM DEFAULT DEPARTMENT
      *C    INSTEAD OF THE SYSTEM DEPARTMENT TO DEFAULT TO.
      *C
      *C    AUG 28, 1995  CA YODER    REQ #95-022
      *C    CHANGED THE CALCULATION FOR DATE WANTED.  INSTEAD OF USING THE
      *C    SHIP TIME, THE AVERAGE OF THE 3 LEAD TIMES ARE USED TO OBTAIN
      *C    DATE WANTED.  SHIP TIME IS USED TO CALCULATE THE SHIP DATE NOT
      *C    THE DATE WANTED.
      *C
      *C    DEC  7, 1995  JE COFFMAN
      *C    ADDED THE ABILITY TO SET A FLAG IN THE MREQ BUFFER WHENEVER
      *C    LEAD TIMES WERE USED TO CALCULATE THE DATE WANTED FIELD. THE
      *C    MATERIALS CONTROL USERS IN NAPANEE REQUESTED THIS CHANGE SO
      *C    THAT WHEN THEY ARE PROCESSING THE REQ VIA MA2 THE DATE WANTED
      *C    FIELD COULD APPEAR AS A FLASHING FIELD TO SIGNAL THAT THEY
      *C    SHOULD NOT OVERRIDE IT.
      *C
      *C    JUN 18, 1996   CA YODER
      *C    MODIFIED FOR CENTURY DATABASE CHANGES.
      *C
      *C    FEB 1, 1999    JE COFFMAN
      *C    ADDED LOGIC TO INDICATE THAT A REQUISITION MIGHT BE AWAITING
      *C    APPROVALS FOR A CODED ITEM. TED DUNAY IN LAWTON THOUGHT THIS
      *C    MIGHT HELP THE MATERIALS CONTROL PERSON TO KNOW WHAT HE
      *C    SHOULD DO REGARDING REOREDERING.
      *C
008800
008900
