032300 MANUAL-REQ-CREATE SECTION.
       BEGIN.
032400     PERFORM 1-HSK THRU 1-H-X.
032500
032600     PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-M-X.

           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE, MPLTINFO-O, MSTORERM-O, MREQFILE-O,
                 MREQ-O, DREQITM-O.
032700
032800     GOBACK.
032900
033000
033100 1-HSK.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE, MPLTINFO-O, MSTORERM-O, MREQFILE-O,
                    MREQ-O, DREQITM-O.

033200     MOVE   3 TO LANG-SETNUM.
033300     MOVE  18 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
033400     PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
033500     MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO REQ-MSG-LINE1.
033600     MOVE  66 TO LANG-SETNUM.
033700     MOVE 221 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
033800     PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
033900     MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO OPEN-REQ-MSG1.
034000
034100
034200**********************************************
034300*    RETRIEVE PDER-SW FROM PLANT STARTUP     *
034400*    USER ROUTINES TO DETERMINE IF PROGRAM   *
034500*    IS TO CARRYOVER DEPT AND EXPENSE CLASS  *
034600*    ON REQUISITION CREATES                  *
034700**********************************************
034800
           MOVE "Y"            TO  SAVE-PDER-SW.
034900     MOVE "PDER"         TO  PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-O.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
035300         MOVE "MPLTINFO FAILED *SREQMAN*" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
035400         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
035500     MOVE MPLTINFO-PDER-SW  TO  SAVE-PDER-SW.
035700
034200**********************************************
034300*                                            *
034400*    DO DBGET MPLTINFO WITH  "P 01" =        *
034500*    PLTINFO-KEY TO GET PLANT CODE           *
034600*                                            *
034700**********************************************
034800
034900     MOVE "P 01"         TO  PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-O.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
035300         MOVE "MPLTINFO FAILED P 01" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
035400         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
035500     MOVE MPLTINFO-COMPANY  TO  COMPANY-SAVE.
035600     MOVE MPLTINFO-PRIME    TO  PRIME-SAVE.
035700
035800**************************************************
035900*                                                *
036000*   GET STOREROOM FROM MPLTINFO USING 'P 03'     *
036100*   AS THE ARGUMENT IT IS USED TO PRINT ON REQ   *
036200*                                                *
036300**************************************************
036400
036500     MOVE "P 03"  TO  PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-O.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
037000             MOVE SPACES  TO  STOREROOM-SAVE
037100         ELSE
037200         MOVE "DBGET MPLTINFO 1-HSK"  TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
037300         MOVE PLT-ARG               TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (3)
037400         GO TO 2-BLOWUP
037500     ELSE
037600     MOVE MPLTINFO-STOREROOM  TO  STOREROOM-SAVE.
037700
037800*********************************************
037900*                                           *
038000*  DO DBGET MPLTINFO WITH "P 20" =          *
038100*  PLTINFO-KEY TO GET THE ORDERING COST     *
038200*  AND CARRYING COST FOR EOQ CALCULATIONS   *
038300*                                           *
038400*********************************************
038500
038600     MOVE "P 20"         TO  PLT-ARG.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-O.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
039000         MOVE "GET MPLTINFO *1-HSK" TO  BU-DISPLAY-MSG
039100         MOVE PLT-ARG               TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (2)
039200         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
039300
039400     MOVE MPLTINFO-CARRY-COST  TO  EOQ-CARRY-COST.
039500     IF EOQ-CARRY-COST = ZEROS
039600         MOVE 0.30             TO  EOQ-CARRY-COST.
039700     IF MPLTINFO-EXP-ORDER-COST NUMERIC
039800         MOVE MPLTINFO-EXP-ORDER-COST  TO  EOQ-ORDER-COST
039900     ELSE
040000         MOVE MPLTINFO-ORDER-COST      TO  EOQ-ORDER-COST
040100         PERFORM 11-MOVE-MPLTINFO-ORDER-COST  THRU  11-MMOC-X.
040200
040300     ACCEPT CUR-DATE-YMD       FROM DATE.
      *---------- ACCOUNT FOR CENTURY.
           IF CUR-DATE-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19"             TO  CUR-DATE-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20"             TO  CUR-DATE-CC.

      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-O.
           START MPLTINFO-O KEY > PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC-O
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.
042400 1-H-X.
042500     EXIT.
042600
042700****************************************************
042800**  THIS IS A TEMPORARY ROUTINE THAT MOVES
042900**  ORDERING COSTS FROM A 2 BYTE FIELD TO A 6
043000**  BYTE FIELD ON THE SAME RECORD IN MPLTINFO
043100**  THIS WAS NEEDED SINCE ORDERING COSTS IS TOO
043200**  SMALL
043300****************************************************
043400
043500 11-MOVE-MPLTINFO-ORDER-COST.
044600     MOVE MPLTINFO-ORDER-COST     TO  MPLTINFO-EXP-ORDER-COST.
044700     MOVE ZEROS                   TO  MPLTINFO-ORDER-COST.
           REWRITE MPLTINFO-REC-O FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
045100         MOVE "UPDATE MPLTINFO * 11-MMOC" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
045200         GO TO 2-BLOWUP.
045300
046000 11-MMOC-X.
046100     EXIT.
046200
046300*********************************************
046400*                                           *
046500*  BLOWUP ROUTINE EXECUTES WHENEVER A       *
046600*  FATAL ERROR OCCURS                       *
046700*                                           *
046800*********************************************
046900
047000 2-BLOWUP.
047100     MOVE "SREQMAN"               TO  BU-PGM-NAME.
047200     MOVE CODE-ARG                TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
047300     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
047400         VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
047500                 BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
047600
047700 2-BLOWUP-X.
047800     EXIT.
047900
050800
050900 4-PGM-ERROR.
           MOVE B"1" TO IND (FIELD-NUMBER), IND (99).
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO DE1-MESSAGE-LINE.
051300
051800 4-PGM-ERROR-X.
051900     EXIT.
052000
054200
