054500*  M A I N                *
054600*                         *
054700***************************
054800
054900 6-MAIN.
055000     MOVE "REQMAN1"   TO  VIEW-NFNAME.
           MOVE SPACES      TO SCREEN-1.
057000
057100 6-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-1.
           MOVE SCREEN-1       TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC    TO SCREEN-1.
058900
059000     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
059100         GO TO 6-M-X
059200     ELSE
060600     IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
060700        VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
060800        VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
060900        VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
060900        VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
061000        VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
061100        VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
061300*        "INVALID FUNCTION KEY ENTERED"
061400         MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
061500         MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
061600         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
061700         MOVE 1  TO  FIELD-NUMBER
061800         PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
061900         GO TO 6-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-1.
064000
      *------ FIELD EDITS

           IF SCREEN-CORP-CODE = SPACES
      *          YOU MUST ENTER A CORPORATE CODE
               MOVE 66170 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
069800         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
069900         MOVE 1  TO FIELD-NUMBER
070000         PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
070100         GO TO 6-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-1.

           IF SCREEN-CREATE-REQ = SPACES  AND
              SCREEN-UPDATE-REQFILE = SPACES
      *         YOU MUST CHOOSE AN OPTION
               MOVE 66218 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
069800         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
069900         MOVE 2  TO FIELD-NUMBER
070000         PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
070100         GO TO 6-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-1.

           IF SCREEN-CREATE-REQ NOT = SPACES AND
              SCREEN-UPDATE-REQFILE NOT = SPACES
      *         SELECT ONLY ONE OPTION
               MOVE 66140 TO CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER
069800         PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
069900         MOVE 3  TO FIELD-NUMBER
070000         PERFORM 4-PGM-ERROR  THRU  4-PGM-ERROR-X
070100         GO TO 6-SHOWFORM-SCREEN-1.

064100*************************************************
064200*                                               *
064300*   EDIT CHECK CORP CODE FOR VALID CORP CODE    *
064400*                                               *
064500*************************************************
064600
           MOVE SPACES            TO  SAVE-AUTH-FLAG.
064700     MOVE SCREEN-CORP-CODE  TO  CODE-ARG.
           MOVE CODE-ARG TO CORPCDE OF MSTORERM-REC-O.
           READ MSTORERM-O INTO BUF-MSTORERM
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
