           END-PERFORM.
           MOVE STR-EST-LT   TO SHIP-TIME.
           MOVE SPACES       TO EXPECT-DATE.

           CALL "SCALCEDT" USING PASSED-PARAMETERS.
           MOVE 4                 TO  DATE-MODE.
