           IF HOLD-DATE-YY > "70"
               MOVE "19"          TO  HOLD-DATE-CC
           ELSE
               MOVE "20"          TO  HOLD-DATE-CC.

           MOVE HOLD-DATE-CN  TO REQ-DATE-WANTED-CN.
           IF STR-EST-LT > 0
