106200 62-COMPUTE-EOQ.
106300     IF STR-MTH-FCST > 0
106400         NEXT SENTENCE
106500     ELSE
106600         GO TO 62-UPDATE-MSTORERM.
106700
106800     MULTIPLY STR-MTH-FCST          BY
106900              12                    GIVING EOQ-ANNUAL-USAGE.
107000
107100     MULTIPLY EOQ-ORDER-COST        BY
107200              2                     GIVING EOQ-TWICE-ORDER-COST.
107300
107400     MULTIPLY EOQ-TWICE-ORDER-COST  BY
107500              EOQ-ANNUAL-USAGE      GIVING EOQ-NUMERATOR.
107600
107700     IF STR-MKT-COST = ZEROS
107800         MOVE STR-AVG-COST TO EOQ-UNIT-COST
107900     ELSE
108000         MOVE STR-MKT-COST TO EOQ-UNIT-COST.
108100
108200
108300     MULTIPLY EOQ-UNIT-COST         BY
108400              EOQ-CARRY-COST        GIVING EOQ-DENOMINATOR.
108500
108600     DIVIDE   EOQ-NUMERATOR         BY
108700              EOQ-DENOMINATOR       GIVING EOQ-SQ.
108800
108900     COMPUTE  EOQ-SQ-ROOT ROUNDED = EOQ-SQ ** .5.
109000     MOVE EOQ-SQ-ROOT           TO  STR-EOQ.
